EAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46280348/1cd8ff96fb71eea7816bc783345fe202b8503db5.jpg Runes first The rune effects have been reworked, the rune rail is lit warmer, and every stone sits in a fitted tray. Previews now tell you clearly what a rune will do before you cast it. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46280348/2cca6772120feb0e8b3bf2d4a7535a4a6bb001e8.jpg A table wort","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T15:06:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498224875","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:33:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5163190-1843481262690657","game_id":"steam-5163190","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is out now!","summary":"The Tumble Tavern demo is live, and it's free.It's Farkle, played against a tavern of rivals who each have their own style at the table, and their own tells!What turns a run around is the runes. Enchanted, limited, and yours to spend: hold a throw together, swing the odds, take control of the table when it's slipping away from you.Windows and native Linux/SteamOS, full controller support.Tumble Tavern launches 12 November. Wishlist today! Proudly made by Guildhelm Studios.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T00:13:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690657","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:33:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5163190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:46Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5163190":"2026-10-26T09:06:46Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5163190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09: